The icons in solar.json are adapted from the Solar Icons Set by 480 Design
(https://www.figma.com/community/file/1166831539721848736), as packaged by
Hakim Saoudi in https://github.com/saoudi-h/solar-icons.

The Solar Icons Set is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes: the Linear style was redrawn as skeletons whose corners follow the
theme radius (flat at radius 0), at Solar's own 1.5 stroke. Some
icons were recomposed for zz (window and pane glyphs share one frame, arrow
shafts stop short of the tip), and icons the set lacks (the keyboard keys,
the terminal prompt, New window, New session, Add host, case sensitivity,
the asterisk) were drawn by zz in its style. Icons without a "solar" field
are zz's own.
